                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What is Slurrp Farm's biggest advantage?</h3>
                                        <p>Millet-based + Indian-heritage positioning + mother-focused marketing. Category-defining in kids healthy food combined with policy tailwinds (2023 International Year of Millets).</p>
                                        <h3>Can new kids food brands compete?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes in sub-category niching (organic, allergy-friendly, specific-age-focused). Slurrp Farm dominates general kids healthy food.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the biggest lesson for F&amp;B founders?</h3>
                                        <p>Identify actual decision-maker + build cultural + health-conscious positioning. Combined, defensible.</p>
                                        <h3>Is millet as a category sustainable long-term?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes — global millet awareness growing, government policy support, generational health-consciousness. Compounding tailwinds.</p>
